  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed both as a noun ({抗議|こうぎ}) and as a suru verb ({抗議|こうぎ}する). The particle に{対|たい}して or に is used to mark the target of the protest.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- [target]に{抗議|こうぎ}する: to protest against [target]\n- [target]に{対|たい}して{抗議|こうぎ}する: to lodge a protest against [target]\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {抗議|こうぎ}デモ: protest demonstration\n- {抗議|こうぎ}{活動|かつどう}: protest activity\n- {抗議|こうぎ}{声明|せいめい}: protest statement\n- {抗議|こうぎ}の{声|こえ}: voice of protest\n- {厳重|げんじゅう}に{抗議|こうぎ}する: to strongly protest",
